---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Palworld 1.0 Guide Hub, an unofficial fan-made English guide site focused on practical Version 1.0 articles."
  canonical="/about/"
>
  <section class="page-hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About Palworld 1.0 Guide Hub</h1>
    <p>A focused English guide hub for players preparing for Palworld Version 1.0.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="text-page">
    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      Palworld 1.0 Guide Hub is an unofficial fan-made guide site built for practical launch-week questions:
      how to start, what returning players should check, how to plan a server, how to think about fresh saves,
      and what to watch when the final patch notes are available.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site is not</h2>
    <p>
      This is not a complete Palworld Wiki, item database, Pal database, or official news source. The MVP keeps
      scope narrow so pages can stay accurate and useful.
    </p>

    <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
    <p>
      Before Palworld 1.0 is live, articles avoid unconfirmed exact details. Once official patch notes are available,
      guides can be updated with confirmed changes and clearer recommendations.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

